You can blank scrolls at every body of water if you have water walking
boots. And being able to blank scrolls really isn't a necessity anyway.
Writing scrolls is highly overrated in my book.

And I personally think that you are playing too careful: some of the
things you're apparently waiting for *really* aren't necessary, but only
(very) nice to have, like conflict, reflection, magic markers and
enchant foo scrolls. Personally, I consider magic resistance the one
thing you should still have.

